WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.086
[Jonathan] What's your name?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.339
[Cairo] Cairo Sweet.

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:06.840
- I'm Mr. Miller.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.592
I'm assuming that you
got one of these before.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.761
- I read the whole list.

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.679
- Well, there's twelve books
on that list.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:13.555
- Party hard.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:18.477
♪ Always said I was
a good kid ♪

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.020
- What is an adult?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.521
♪ Always said I had... ♪

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.522
I'm eighteen.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.024
♪ ...with words ♪

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.443
Languishing in the wilds
of Nowhere, Tennessee.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:30.989
♪ Don't know how I'll ever
break this curse ♪

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.159
[Jonathan] Don't you get scared
walking through those woods?

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.535
- I'm the scariest thing
in there.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.037
(Jonathan laughs)

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.375
♪ Never knew I could
be speechless ♪

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.128
[Jonathan] I want you to
write a short story

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.506
in the style of your
favorite author.

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:50.133
- Are you offering me special
treatment, Mr. Miller?

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.468
- Well... uh.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.681
[Boris] John here is prepping
her to be his transcendence.

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:56.890
[Beatrice] Is she pretty?

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.309
- Oh, she's talented.
- Damn, even worse.

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:01.395
[Winnie] What are you
writing about?

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.564
- I'm uninspired. I've
had no achievement.

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:06.149
- Make him love you.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:11.738
♪ I'll set fire to the
whole place ♪

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.615
♪ I don't know how I'll ever ♪

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.242
[Cairo] She opened her mouth
to say something,

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:18.996
but the words fell away.

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:24.501
- Why did you write this?
This is inappropriate.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.086
- "Write what you know," is what
you said.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.796
- If you don't rewrite
this, I'll have to fail you.

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:31.258
- I dare you.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:37.597
♪ I feel down, I feel down,
I feel down, I feel down ♪

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.224
- It's like he's been living
in gray scale

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:41.393
and you're the first thing
he's ever seen in color.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:45.063
♪ I feel down, I feel down,
I feel down ♪

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:47.566
- You are the adult. Show
some responsibility.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:51.194
- You're my student. And I'm
your teacher. That's all.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:54.865
♪ Burn it down, burn it down,
burn it down ♪

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:57.367
[Jonathan] If she can convince
them that something happened

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.161
between us, I can lose my job.

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:00.287
- That's not all you could lose.

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:02.748
- You're gonna ruin his life.

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:06.251
♪ Burn it down, burn it down,
burn it down ♪

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:10.881
♪ Down, down, down, down, down ♪

00:02:12.758 --> 00:02:15.552
[Joyce] In your own words,
how did it start?

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:18.555
♪ Always said I was a good kid ♪

